		"body": "## What this changes\n\nCloses #32. Restore direct Read, Pin, Reply, Archive, Snooze and Trash buttons on mail rows using the current flat icon style, without bevels or shadows. Keep More actions for the full menu.\n\nWide lists expose buttons on hover, selection or keyboard focus. Narrow and touch lists place them below the message, with matching virtual-list height. Existing handlers and guards preserve exact targeting and Trash confirmation without selecting or opening the row.\n\n## Ownership and scope\n\n- Task and delivery owner: this change's author, one writer.\n- Owned paths: renderer App, MailListWindow, mail/MailList, row-action tests and mail-list styles; CHANGELOG, DESIGN, KB and ADR 0066.\n- Base: main; feature: fix/flat-mail-row-actions.\n- Coordination search found no overlapping active task or PR. Task #32 records ownership.\n- One task commit based on current upstream, excluding unrelated history.\n\n## How it was verified\n\n- [x] Bounded npm test: 1,092 passed, zero failures.\n- [x] Bounded npm run build: passed strict TypeScript, renderer and desktop bundles.\n- [x] Focused row-action tests: 7/7 passed.\n- [x] Diff whitespace and commit-email checks passed.\n- Linux, Node 24.22.1, exact head 7f42fa250ca6cc5260f9481bd54032d0b403291f.\n- Commands ran serially with Fleet memory limits and external deadlines.\n\n- No private account data, credentials or machine paths added. Tests use synthetic mail.\n- Affected design, knowledge and changelog documentation updated.\n- Installed appearance and physical input remain unverified. Screenshots unavailable because interactive UI checks were not run.\n\n## Review\n\n- Separate read-only Codex GPT-6.1 Sol reviewer: ship, no findings.\n- Base: 374c3371c9d3b138ce524616dd9f8a140709a0de.\n- Head: 7f42fa250ca6cc5260f9481bd54032d0b403291f.\n- Complete binary diff SHA256: d1f447bc068696075e8bb7221ae839b0a71712c56646c46f1863e40bd63a92f6.\n- Prior narrow-row sender overlap resolved by placing controls below the message.\n- File-only delivery. No merge or release requested.\n\nModel(s): gpt-6.1-sol\n\nHarness: T3 Code, Codex\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/collection-of-things/codesmith/aggregate-mail/pr/33?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795485588&installation_model_id=440725&pr_number=33&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=collection-of-things%2Faggregate-mail&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fcollection-of-things%2Faggregate-mail%2Fpull%2F33&signature=5bbf5733e6afb0eac1b6cff5b78435faa3eff85557f1eb0ed902d6709fa1d62c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
